@startuml 
title "Domain Model - Card"

rectangle Card
rectangle Spell
rectangle Equipment
rectangle Combatant
rectangle Leader
rectangle Warrior
rectangle Rarity
rectangle Cooldown
rectangle Statistic
rectangle Name
rectangle Effect
rectangle Description

Card *--> Name
Card *--> Description

Card <|-- Spell
Card <|-- Equipment 
Card <|-- Combatant 

Spell *--> Effect : cause

Equipment --> Combatant : equipped on
Equipment --> Statistic : increment or decrement

Combatant <|-- Leader
Combatant <|-- Warrior
Combatant *--> "3    " Statistic
Combatant *--> Cooldown

Warrior *---> Rarity

note bottom of Effect
	An **Effect** is a series of operations 
	that affect the **Game state** when a 
	**Event** happen, in this case, when a
	**Spell** is used
end note

note left of Combatant
	The **Combatants** require the 
	**3 types of Statistics**
end note

note bottom of Leader
	If **Leader** dies, the player 
	**loses the game**
end note

note bottom of Cooldown
	**One turn** to wait after placing it before
	this **Combatant** can attack
end note

note right of Rarity
 Rarity can be one of these:
....
 Common
 Uncommon
 Rare
 Epic
 Legendary
 Mythic
end note

@enduml